(text "UPS: U8 TP4056 100mA / U9 TPS61230A 4.992V / U10 TPS2117. Protected >=5A 1S pack at J2, 10k/B3950 NTC at J4." (at 25 792 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 678e83ab-9a16-557e-a361-fe4754fd07d7))
(text "Battery ADC: GPIO2 ADC1_CH1, enable GPIO9; 150k/100k + 100nF; Vbat = 2.5 x calibrated ADC volts. Protected 1S 4.2V assumed." (at 25 801 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid cbd083e1-84d4-5857-9910-9e9e319f7e93))
(text "No firmware changes: optional radar RX GPIO6 / reserved TX GPIO8; button GPIO0; modem PWRKEY GPIO11 / RESET GPIO21 proposed only." (at 25 810 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid e3be8d2c-7284-555b-a463-e7ed7384da36))
(text "USB: SERVICE R26/R27/R30 OR HOST R28/R29/R31 + J22, never both. J22 = GND/DP20/DM19. J13 pin28 charge-disable GPIO38, pin29NC. Hardware USB test pending." (at 25 819 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid de4360d1-045a-5dcc-8aac-fdc1a8cf68b4))
(text "J19 VBAT: one shunt only 1-2 internal buck OR 2-3 external regulated 3.8V at J20; none isolates modem. Never 5V at J20." (at 25 828 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 494d196a-ca56-5f37-9cba-1b2615922321))
(text "INPUT: nominal 5V/2A, 4.5-5.5V range. JP4 2-3 = onboard UPS NORMAL; 1-2 = adapter diagnostic bypass. Only one shunt." (at 25 837 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 85c69b52-8cc4-5a3f-be90-225fca71763d))
(text "JP1 one shunt: 1-2 BOARD_REG_5V / SYS_5V OR 2-3 SYS_5V / BENCH_REG_5V. Both sources regulated 5V." (at 25 846 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 353d4377-e242-51b2-9cb3-de125448b6cf))
